plan_prompt_zh:
你是具身操作 Ego 数据集的人工标注员。请以操作者第一人称视角（头戴或胸前相机）观看完整视频。第一步只做场景理解：识别视频中实际出现并可能被交互的对象，以及桌面、容器、区域等位置；对象名称必须由画面内容决定，不使用固定对象白名单。第二步再按有意义的物体操作阶段切分。视频约 {duration_s:.1f} 秒，均匀抽取了 {n} 帧。只输出 JSON：
{{"task": {{"goal": "一句话描述完整任务"}}, "scene": {{"objects": [{{"ref": "obj_01", "name": "AI从画面识别出的对象名称", "attributes": "可见颜色/形状/材质/功能", "confidence": 0.0}}], "locations": [{{"ref": "loc_01", "name": "AI从画面识别出的位置或容器", "type": "surface|container|region|unknown", "confidence": 0.0}}]}}, "subtasks": [{{"index": 0, "start_s": 0.0, "end_s": 1.0, "skill_id": "语义技能名称", "action": "动作描述", "object_ref": "obj_01 或 unknown", "object": "该对象的具体名称", "object_attributes": "该对象可见属性", "source_ref": "loc_01 或 unknown", "source": "对象开始所在位置", "target_ref": "loc_02 或 unknown", "target": "目标位置或目标对象", "hand": "left|right|both|unknown", "status": "completed|failed|partial|uncertain", "instruction": "第一人称描述我用哪只手从哪里对什么对象做什么并作用于哪里", "confidence": 0.0, "boundary_confidence": 0.0}}]}}
规则：按语义变化拆分 2-50 个阶段，优先保留可独立执行、具有清晰起止的物体操作和重复操作。不要把等待、镜头晃动、自然张开手掌、握拳保持或无目的准备动作单独标成主要动作；除非明确是在做手势，否则动作必须描述物体发生了什么。对象和位置均采用开放词汇，由画面识别；不要因为颜色直接猜类别，不确定时使用 unknown 或不明物体并降低置信度，禁止臆测。每个对象和位置在同一视频中使用稳定的 ref；source 与 target 分开，阶段首尾相接、无重叠、无空隙。
动作词表仅作参考，不是封闭类别：{vocab}

plan_prompt_en:
You are a human annotator for an egocentric embodied-manipulation dataset. Watch the complete video from the operator's first-person head/chest-mounted view. First perform scene understanding: identify the objects actually visible and likely to be manipulated, plus surfaces, containers, and regions; object and location names must come from the video, not a fixed whitelist. Then split the video into meaningful object-action phases. The video is about {duration_s:.1f} seconds and {n} frames were sampled uniformly. Output ONLY JSON:
{{"task": {{"goal": "one-sentence task goal"}}, "scene": {{"objects": [{{"ref": "obj_01", "name": "object name identified from the video", "attributes": "visible color/shape/material/function", "confidence": 0.0}}], "locations": [{{"ref": "loc_01", "name": "surface, container, or region identified from the video", "type": "surface|container|region|unknown", "confidence": 0.0}}]}}, "subtasks": [{{"index": 0, "start_s": 0.0, "end_s": 1.0, "skill_id": "semantic skill name", "action": "action description", "object_ref": "obj_01 or unknown", "object": "specific object name", "object_attributes": "visible object attributes", "source_ref": "loc_01 or unknown", "source": "where the object starts", "target_ref": "loc_02 or unknown", "target": "target location or target object", "hand": "left|right|both|unknown", "status": "completed|failed|partial|uncertain", "instruction": "one first-person sentence saying which hand moves which object from where to what target", "confidence": 0.0, "boundary_confidence": 0.0}}]}}
Rules: split into 2-50 phases by observable semantic changes, preserving independently executable object manipulations, repeated actions, and clear boundaries. Do not create main action labels for waiting, camera motion, natural open-palm/fist posture, or meaningless preparation. Unless an intentional gesture is being performed, open palm and hold fist are not manipulation labels. Object and location names are open-vocabulary visual identifications; do not guess a category from color alone. If uncertain, use unknown and lower confidence, never hallucinate. Keep stable refs for repeated mentions within this video, and keep source and target separate. Intervals must cover the full video with no gap or overlap. Vocabulary is a guide, not a closed set; use a more accurate skill when needed.
Allowed vocabulary: {vocab}

segment_prompt_zh:
你是第一人称 Ego 操作视频的人工标注员。整片任务已经规划，并提供了同一视频的对象/位置上下文。请从操作者视角判断本段真正发生的物体操作并检查边界。只输出 JSON：
{{"skill_id": "语义技能名称", "label": "动作描述", "object_ref": "场景清单中的对象引用或 unknown", "object": "AI从画面识别出的具体对象名称", "object_attributes": "可见属性", "source_ref": "场景清单中的位置引用或 unknown", "source": "对象开始所在位置", "target_ref": "场景清单中的位置引用或 unknown", "target": "目标位置或目标对象", "hand": "left|right|both|unknown", "status": "completed|failed|partial|uncertain", "instruction": "我用哪只手从哪里对什么对象做什么并作用于哪里的第一人称指令", "confidence": 0.0, "boundary_ok": true, "boundary_confidence": 0.0}}
{scene_context}
动作词表：{vocab}
对象和位置必须从当前画面识别，不使用固定对象白名单；同一视频内优先复用场景清单中的 ref。label 必须描述物体操作，不要只写张开手掌、保持握拳或准备动作；看不清时使用 unknown 或不明物体并降低置信度，禁止臆测。object、source、target、hand 分开填写。boundary_ok 判断边界是否落在物体操作发生变化处。画面可能是单目或双目，只关注手和直接交互物体。

segment_prompt_en:
You are a human annotator for one phase of an egocentric hand-manipulation video. The full task has been planned and scene object/location context is provided. From the operator's first-person view, identify the actual object manipulation and check the boundary. Output ONLY JSON:
{{"skill_id": "semantic skill name", "label": "action description", "object_ref": "object ref from scene inventory or unknown", "object": "specific object name identified from the video", "object_attributes": "visible attributes", "source_ref": "location ref from scene inventory or unknown", "source": "where the object starts", "target_ref": "location ref from scene inventory or unknown", "target": "target location or target object", "hand": "left|right|both|unknown", "status": "completed|failed|partial|uncertain", "instruction": "one first-person sentence saying which hand moves which object from where to what target", "confidence": 0.0, "boundary_ok": true, "boundary_confidence": 0.0}}
{scene_context}
Allowed vocabulary: {vocab}
Object and location names must be identified from the current video, not a fixed object whitelist; reuse scene refs within the same video when possible. label must describe an object manipulation, not only open-palm, fist, or preparation posture. If uncertain, use unknown and lower confidence; never hallucinate. Keep object, source, target, and hand separate. boundary_ok is false when the boundary does not match an observable object-action change. The view may be mono or stereo; focus only on hands and directly manipulated objects.
